Cell["\<\
The local dimension of the vertices has 32 bins of width 1/4 from 0 to 8. At \
steps 5, 20 and 40:\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->5047578,ExpressionUUID->"5d5cbd3a-e88d-ee42-0b63-35678939b4a8"],

