Cell["Curvature of a flat surface under refinement", "Section",
 CellID->1678275947,ExpressionUUID->"0f15dbd5-5f35-596c-352a-d29f5ac02bb6"],

Cell["\<\
A torus is flat. Its scalar curvature from ball growth stays between -0.04 \
and -0.10 for resolutions 6 to 18 and does not approach 0 over this range:\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->1570109414,ExpressionUUID->"7e9b7e66-629a-1114-26b9-7040172f607e"],

