Cell["Which rules grow a space of finite dimension?", "Section",
 CellID->315698450,ExpressionUUID->"49f5450b-e8d1-97dd-7f8b-5d548965fd27"],

Cell["\<\
The Infrageometry paclet uses three Wolfram models as substrates. Each runs \
for 300 steps of one random match per step, which follows a single history, \
with every two vertices of a hyperedge joined. A dimension that levels off \
marks a space of finite dimension:\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->1751204118,ExpressionUUID->"2570a8a5-7a6f-59e7-530f-410f7f1a2bcd"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

